=== MANANITAS MARIACHI VERSION 2 ===

[CANCION TRADICIONAL]
Traditional Mexican serenade in a slow 3/4 waltz rhythm, moderate-slow tempo, major key, warm and celebratory tone. Simple, singable melody with smooth stepwise motion, minimal syncopation, stable pulse. Homophonic texture with a clear lead melody and gentle harmonic accompaniment. Soft dynamic opening that gradually swells during the chorus without becoming dramatic. Mariachi-style arrangement featuring violins carrying the melody, trumpets providing light accents, and guitar, vihuela, and guitarrón establishing a steady rhythmic and harmonic foundation. Intimate, respectful, and traditional in character.

